— Ukraine’s Main Intelligence Directorate (GUR) “Prymary” Special Unit carried out precision strikes on several high-value Russian assets.
In late October and early November 2026, the unit struck the following Russian targets:
Communications antennas;
• A Starlink jamming station;
• Fuel and lubricant storage tanks;
• An electrical substation transformer;
• Military vehicles;
• Mobile fire teams;
• Armored fighting vehicles (AFVs);
• Engineering equipment and trucks;
• A 9A331 TELAR of the Tor-M1 surface-to-air missile system.
